{"book":"nehemiah","num":6,"verses":[{"en":"Now it came to pass, when Sanballat, and Tobiah, and Geshem the Arabian, and the rest of our enemies, heard that I had builded the wall, and that there was no breach left therein; (though at that time I had not set up the doors upon the gates;)","n":1,"sm":"Ua faalogo Sanepalata, ma Tovia, ma Gesemu le Arapi, atoa ma i latou uma e na ita mai ia te i matou, ua atia e aʻu le pa, ma ua le toe i ai se mea o solo; (a ona po ia na ou le faatuina ai puipui i faitotoa;)","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faalogo"},{"en":"","sm":"Sanepalata,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"Tovia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"Gesemu"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Arapi,"},{"en":"","sm":"atoa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ita"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"matou,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"atia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"pa,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"toe"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"solo;"},{"en":"","sm":"(a"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"po"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faatuina"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"puipui"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"faitotoa;)"}]},{"en":"That Sanballat and Geshem sent unto me, saying, Come, let us meet together in some one of the villages in the plain of Ono. But they thought to do me mischief.","n":2,"sm":"ona sau lea ia te au o le feau a Sanepalata ma Gesemu, ua faapea mai, Sau ia, ina tatou fetaiai i aai i le fanua laugatasi o Ono. A ua latou manatu e fai se mea leaga ia te au.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"sau"},{"en":"","sm":"le